        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "Correction after tracing the config indirection: the runtime key schedule is PasswordDeriveBytes (PBKDF1-style) over the user password with a per-file random 64-byte salt (RNGCryptoServiceProvider) and hash from settings.HashAlgorithm (default SHA1, App.config:31). The effective iteration count at runtime is 1000 (App.config:37-38), user-editable, with NO enforced minimum — SettingsForm.cs:100-102 even coerces a blank value to \"1\". Still ~600x below the OWASP 600k minimum. Remediation must targe"
